### MyCrypto FastAPI v2.0 - Authentication Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### ========================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Register New User
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

###

### Login User and Capture Tokens
# @name loginUser
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

###

### Login with Demo User and Capture Tokens
# @name loginDemo
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@mycrypto.com",
  "password": "demo123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

###

### Get User Profile (Protected Route)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### Verify Token
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### Refresh Token and Update Access Token
# @name refreshToken
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

###

### Logout User
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ========================================
### ERROR SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### Register with Existing Email
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@mycrypto.com",
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login with Wrong Password
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@mycrypto.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### Login with Non-existent User
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Access Protected Route without Token
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/profile

###

### Access Protected Route with Invalid Token
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

###

### Refresh with Invalid Token
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "invalid_refresh_token"
}

###
